DTSTAMP:20260831T094658Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260729
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260730
SUMMARY:Easy 3 km
DESCRIPTION:Easy 3 km — Barcelona\, early AM by feel. Heat inflates HR\; 
 ignore pace and HR\, run by breath.\n\nWeek 4 of 17 - Base\nDOWN WEEK - 
 recover\, do not add volume.\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk t
 est.\nBarcelona Tue-Fri\, then festival at Amsterdamse Bos (Fri evening\
 , Sat\, Sun). Down week — the travel timing is ideal\; nothing here buil
 ds fitness. Benchmark deferred to a cool\, recovered morning (Week 6). T
 he long run folds into Sat festival morning. Festival walking covers the
  volume\; do not add load.\n95 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
