  day.\n\nWeek 4 of 17 - Base\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add volume.\n
 Keep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nBarcelona Tue-Fri\, then
  festival at Amsterdamse Bos (Fri evening\, Sat\, Sun). Down week — the 
