DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260806
SUMMARY:Easy 4-5 km recovery jog
DESCRIPTION:Easy 4-5 km recovery jog — by feel\, conversational\, ignore 
 pace/HR. Walk it in if you feel rough.\n\nWeek 5 of 17 - Build\nKeep HR 
 under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nEASY RE-ENTRY — recovering from 
 the festival weekend. No max efforts\, no heavy legs\, no CP test (moved
  to Week 6\, now a power test on fresh legs). Optional easy 4 km Thu or 
 rest — your call. Run easy by feel\, hydrate\; only if you feel decent. 
 Getting back to baseline is the whole job this week.\n88 days to Ultra X
  Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
