 20/130\, and its own chart puts 155-171 cm on 110\, which is also what s
 ub-165 cm coaches actually run. Buy the Kiprun 500 aluminium at 110 cm\,
  EUR 70. Aluminium bends where carbon snaps\, which is the right failure
  mode on wet basalt for a first-time pole user. Ultra X's 2026 race rule
 s contain no restriction on poles.\n69 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
