 rry. About 3 minutes total added to the session.\n\nWeek 10 of 17 - Buil
 d\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add volume.\nCutback. Deliberate\, and t
 he reason matters: in trail runners\, injury weeks were preceded by load
  DROPPING 16-24% then rebounding 15-37%. Yo-yo loading\, not absolute lo
 ad\, is what precedes injury. This dip is planned and the rebound is con
 trolled.\n52 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
