 r 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nTERRAIN WEEKEND #1 of 2 - Posbank/Ve
 luwezoom\, ~1h15 by car\, ~EUR 30 of petrol. Hard-surface descents\, 90-
 110 m climbs. Twenty reps is 1\,800 m of real ascent AND descent. One da
