DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260916
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260917
SUMMARY:Push (upper)
DESCRIPTION:Push (upper) - after the easy run. Fresh\, not on legs you ju
 st destroyed.\n\nWeek 11 of 17 - Build\nTERRAIN WEEKEND #1 of 2 - Posban
 k/Veluwezoom\, ~1h15 by car\, ~EUR 30 of petrol. Hard-surface descents\,
  90-110 m climbs. Twenty reps is 1\,800 m of real ascent AND descent. On
 e day there beats ten stairwell sessions\, because sand is compliant and
  actually REDUCES muscle damage relative to firm ground. Madeira is rock
  and stone steps.\n46 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
