DESCRIPTION:LONG DAY 2:55\, 1\,100 m vert\, full kit\, poles\, 60 g/h DES
 CENT CUE: shorten the step\, 185-195 spm. Understriding cut strength los
 s to -8.8% vs -15.5% at preferred step length - roughly halved. Do NOT c
