 nWeek 16 of 17 - Taper\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\n
 Taper starts. Volume down 45-55%\, intensity and frequency UNCHANGED - t
 hat combination is worth 2-3%\, about 7-11 minutes on a 6-hour race. NOT
 HING ECCENTRIC AFTER 21 OCTOBER. Last heavy lower-body work is done.\n11
  days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
