SUMMARY:▲ VERTICAL 40 min
DESCRIPTION:VERTICAL 40 min - STAIRWELL\, your own building or a car park
 . ~11 x 15 floors\, about 495 m. Lift up\, WALK DOWN - the descent is th
 e point. Dutch stair pitch is 30-33 deg\, inside the optimal climbing ra
 nge\, and Madeira is full of stone staircases. Zero travel\, weather-pro
 of.\n\nWeek 16 of 17 - Taper\nTaper starts. Volume down 45-55%\, intensi
 ty and frequency UNCHANGED - that combination is worth 2-3%\, about 7-11
  minutes on a 6-hour race. NOTHING ECCENTRIC AFTER 21 OCTOBER. Last heav
 y lower-body work is done.\n10 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
